  "contracts": {
    "guest_constructor": "145b21850 clears xmm0 at145b21a8b and stores sixteen zero bytes at Game+0xfdc at145b21a96, covering cached host reconnecting+0xfea and local relay retry+0xfeb. It retains the service Arc flags.",
    "guest_close": "145b226b0 moves the role to Off and invokes guest vtable slot0x30=145c053b0. That method disables only the particular guest handle, sends Leave to the primary and selected secondary, removes/closes the secondary, and never clears service active-guest+0x1e0 or guest-reconnecting+0x1e2 (Arc+0x1f8/+0x1fa).",
    "service_activeguest": "Canonical current145bf6e00 case2 (Joined) sets service+0x1e0=1; case7 (Closed27) clears it. Controls31/32 for peer0 copy this retained service byte or zero into+0x1e2, including while no active Game guest handle exists. Local Leave is distinct from Closed27.",
    "source_requirement": "Retain active-guest and guest-reconnecting with the service wrapper/Arc across Session replacement. New Joined keeps the existing service reconnecting flag but starts fresh false sample caches. Selected relay reset clears the reconnecting flag; new service construction begins a new flag lifetime.",
    "status": "145b22c10 publishes role/state/size/code JSON; it changes neither service flags nor sampled reconnection caches."
